<title>USA: NY Life CEO post to change hands April 1.</title>
<headline>NY Life CEO post to change hands April 1.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York Life Insurance Co said on Monday that Sy Sternberg will assume the positions of chairman and chief executive officer, effective April 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Sternberg has held the title of president since October 1995 and will retain that title, the company said.</p>
<p>Sternberg succeeds Harry Hohn, New York Life's chairman and chief executive officer since 1990, the company said. Hohn is retiring after 40 years with the company, New York Life said.</p>
